    },
    "A private home for every bag you collect: what it was, how strong, who grew it and how much is left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A private home for every bag you collect: what it was, how strong, who grew it and how much is left."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een eigen plek voor elk zakje dat je verzamelt: wat het was, hoe sterk, van welke teler en hoeveel er over is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proper reveal, new cards like Plot twist and Chef's choice, and a guaranteed legendary after 20 spins without one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A proper reveal, new cards like Plot twist and Chef's choice, and a guaranteed legendary after 20 spins without one."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een echte onthulling, nieuwe kaarten zoals Plotwending en Keuze van de chef, en gegarandeerd een legendarische na 20 keer draaien zonder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rare gold card worth 3 points. If none has come up in 20 spins, the next one is legendary. Mark any game or rule as legendary in its editor. Skipping one is always fine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rare gold card worth 3 points. If none has come up in 20 spins, the next one is legendary. Mark any game or rule as legendary in its editor. Skipping one is always fine."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een zeldzame gouden kaart, 3 punten waard. Is er 20 keer draaien geen gekomen, dan is de volgende legendarisch. Maak elk spel of elke regel legendarisch in de editor. Overslaan mag altijd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule for the whole table, like talking like a pirate, that lasts five spins." : {
