          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bags, preroll packs and jars. Photograph the front, and the back if you like. Taima reads the name, THC, weight, dates, codes and grower on this iPhone. Check the values and fix anything before saving." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bags, preroll packs and jars. Photograph the front, and the back if you like. Taima reads the name, THC, weight, dates, codes and grower on this iPhone. Check the values and fix anything before saving."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zakjes, prerolls en potjes. Fotografeer de voorkant en eventueel de achterkant. Taima leest naam, THC, gewicht, datums, codes en teler op deze iPhone. Controleer en verbeter de waarden voor je opslaat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bars no longer overlap their labels, sizes compare by grams, and growers get their own colours." : {
