    "Decarboxylation turns THCA into THC. Spread ground flower thinly on baking paper and keep the oven below 125 °C to protect terpenes. Oven thermostats vary, so an oven thermometer helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decarboxylation turns THCA into THC. Spread ground flower thinly on baking paper and keep the oven below 125 °C to protect terpenes. Oven thermostats vary, so an oven thermometer helps."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bij decarboxyleren wordt THCA omgezet in THC. Spreid gemalen wiet dun uit op bakpapier en houd de oven onder 125 °C om terpenen te behouden. Oventhermostaten verschillen, dus een oventhermometer helpt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
