    "Deleting Taima deletes everything in it, so keep a backup. Backups are protected with your passphrase. Leaving Taima out of iCloud backups keeps your records off Apple's servers, but then only your own backups can bring them back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deleting Taima deletes everything in it, so keep a backup. Backups are protected with your passphrase. Leaving Taima out of iCloud backups keeps your records off Apple's servers, but then only your own backups can bring them back."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je Taima verwijdert, verwijder je ook alle gegevens. Bewaar dus een back-up. Back-ups zijn beveiligd met je wachtzin. Door Taima uit te sluiten van iCloud-back-ups blijven je gegevens van Apples servers. Je kunt ze dan alleen terugzetten met je eigen back-ups."
          }
        }
      }
    },
