    "For prerolls and jars: turn the label slowly in front of the camera. Taima reads every side, combines what it sees and keeps the clearest frame as the photo. Find it in the + menu, or under photos in the editor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For prerolls and jars: turn the label slowly in front of the camera. Taima reads every side, combines what it sees and keeps the clearest frame as the photo. Find it in the + menu, or under photos in the editor."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voor prerolls en potjes: draai het etiket langzaam voor de camera. Taima leest alle kanten, voegt de gegevens samen en bewaart het scherpste beeld als foto. Je vindt dit in het plusmenu of onder foto’s bij het bewerken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Four weeks: studies of daily users saw cannabinoid receptors largely back to normal around here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Four weeks: studies of daily users saw cannabinoid receptors largely back to normal around here."
