    "Labels are read on this iPhone. Photos are stored without location data. Taima has no account or analytics. Its only network use is the optional daily update check, which downloads public files from GitHub and sends nothing about you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Labels are read on this iPhone. Photos are stored without location data. Taima has no account or analytics. Its only network use is the optional daily update check, which downloads public files from GitHub and sends nothing about you."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Etiketten worden op deze iPhone gelezen. Foto’s worden zonder locatiegegevens opgeslagen. Taima heeft geen account of analytics. De app gebruikt alleen internet voor de optionele dagelijkse updatecontrole. Die downloadt openbare bestanden van GitHub en verstuurt niets over jou."
